        <mxCell id="nYEByC1A5JROMITaYMs7-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Simulate the Cart+Pendulum (Plant) + Controller&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inputs: reference angle, initial angle, initial rotational speed, initial position, initial speed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outputs: x, x_dot, theta, theta_dot&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
