        <mxCell id="nYEByC1A5JROMITaYMs7-9" value="so we need three classes:&lt;div&gt;1. Plant&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Controller&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Reference/Profiler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;each class will have the relevant methods &lt;br&gt;necessary to simulate the pendulum correctly&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;will have to consider how I get the timing done correctly...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;effectively introduce a ZOH on the Plant input?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;and only sample at T seconds for the controller calculations?&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
